  "note": "RECIPE-VOCAB-V1 r1.3 golden. Imported from holo-emitter's draft (m046211) and corrected by the settled points: `outdoors` is a timeless boolean; the door's `fixture` is a timeless manifest row (the draft gave it valid_from 0); the code is a canon row plus the same row in knows:person:dog; the door is `locked · true` and also `state · shut` (r1.2/r1.3). The draft cited sentence 5, but the story has four sentences: the door, the keypad and the outside are all in sentence 4.",
